# Applied by .github/workflows/build-push.yaml as "<Dockerfile>.dockerignore"
# for builds whose context is the multi-repo workspace root ("source").
# BuildKit only reads <context>/.dockerignore or <Dockerfile>.dockerignore, so the
# per-service src/.dockerignore files never apply to that context.
# Patterns are relative to the context root.
**/.git
**/.github
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.secrets
**/npm-debug.log*
**/coverage
